---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import titleScreen from '../assets/blog/title-screen.png';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="About this devlog and Seoul Nights"
	pubDate={new Date('Oct 12 2026')}
	heroImage={titleScreen}
>
	<p>
		This is the devlog for <strong>Seoul Nights</strong>, a browser 3D taekwondo action game: train
		at a small dojang in a neon Seoul alley district, earn belts, and take on a street gang
		pressuring local shops. No downloads, no installs — it runs in the browser at
		<a href="https://taekwondo.jayeonsoft.com">taekwondo.jayeonsoft.com</a>, guest play included.
	</p>
	<p>
		Built solo with Vite, TypeScript and Three.js — every character and prop is procedural geometry,
		no external art files. Posts here are devlogs on what shipped and why, written as features land
		rather than on a schedule.
	</p>
</Layout>
